{
  "script_id": "cross-cap",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.97,
      "size": 63504,
      "text": "拿一张圆形的纸片，现在请你做一件听起来不可能的事：把边界上每一对正对着的点，也就是对径点，两两粘到一起。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.05,
      "size": 64800,
      "text": "粘完以后得到的这个曲面，数学上叫实射影平面。它是拓扑学里最基本的曲面之一，地位仅次于球面和环面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.83,
      "size": 61200,
      "text": "麻烦在于，这个粘合在三维空间里没法干净地完成。今天要看的交叉帽，就是完成这次粘合的最简单方案。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "why-1",
      "filename": "why-why-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/why-why-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.77,
      "size": 60336,
      "text": "想象你捏着圆盘的边缘，试着把对面的两点凑在一起。凑一对不难，难的是要同时凑好所有的对径点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "why-2",
      "filename": "why-why-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/why-why-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.9,
      "size": 62352,
      "text": "当你把一半边界往上抬、另一半往下压，纸面自己就会撞上自己。这不是手笨，而是拓扑学上无法回避的结论。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "why-3",
      "filename": "why-why-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/why-why-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.01,
      "size": 64224,
      "text": "射影平面无法嵌入三维空间，只能浸入。所谓浸入，就是允许曲面自己穿过自己，但每一小块仍然是光滑的。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "structure",
      "line_id": "st-1",
      "filename": "structure-st-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/structure-st-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.56,
      "size": 56880,
      "text": "看屏幕上这顶帽子。它的下方有一条竖直的线段，那里就是曲面穿过自己的地方，我们叫它自交线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "structure",
      "line_id": "st-2",
      "filename": "structure-st-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/structure-st-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.26,
      "size": 52128,
      "text": "自交线的两端各有一个特殊的点，叫分支点。在分支点上曲面被捏成了一个尖，不再光滑。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "structure",
      "line_id": "st-3",
      "filename": "structure-st-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/structure-st-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.92,
      "size": 62640,
      "text": "交叉帽的结构可以一句话总结：一条自交线，两个分支点。这是三维空间里实现射影平面所需的最小代价。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "compare",
      "line_id": "cmp-1",
      "filename": "compare-cmp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/compare-cmp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.02,
      "size": 64368,
      "text": "实现射影平面的方式不止一种。斯坦纳的罗马曲面有三条自交线和六个分支点，对称性比交叉帽漂亮得多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "compare",
      "line_id": "cmp-2",
      "filename": "compare-cmp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/compare-cmp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.6,
      "size": 57600,
      "text": "博伊曲面更进一步，它一个分支点都没有，整张曲面处处光滑，代价是自交线拧成了复杂的三叶形状。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "compare",
      "line_id": "cmp-3",
      "filename": "compare-cmp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/compare-cmp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.27,
      "size": 68256,
      "text": "三种方案各有取舍：交叉帽最简单，罗马曲面最对称，博伊曲面最光滑。它们是同一个拓扑曲面的三张不同面孔。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "explore",
      "line_id": "exp-1",
      "filename": "explore-exp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/explore-exp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.93,
      "size": 46944,
      "text": "请拖动高度滑块。你会看到自交线段随之伸长或缩短，但它永远不会消失。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "explore",
      "line_id": "exp-2",
      "filename": "explore-exp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/explore-exp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.39,
      "size": 54288,
      "text": "两个分支点也始终待在自交线的两端。无论怎么调参数，一条线两个点这个结构都保持不变。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "explore",
      "line_id": "exp-3",
      "filename": "explore-exp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/explore-exp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.41,
      "size": 54576,
      "text": "这正是拓扑不变性的体现：形状可以随意变形，但自交的结构是这个曲面的固有属性，去不掉。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.01,
      "size": 48096,
      "text": "第一，射影平面由圆盘边界的对径点粘合而成，在三维空间只能浸入不能嵌入。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.43,
      "size": 38880,
      "text": "第二，交叉帽是最简单的浸入方案，只有一条自交线和两个分支点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cross-cap",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cross-cap/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.48,
      "size": 55728,
      "text": "第三，欧拉示性数等于一，是奇数，这告诉我们它不可定向。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
